<title>SRI LANKA: Elastomeric six-month net sharply up.</title>
<headline>Elastomeric six-month net sharply up.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results of Elastomeric Engineering Co Ltd for the six months to September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>		    6 months 1996	   6 months 1995</p>
<p>    Turnover	  143.53	vs	  111.05</p>
<p>    Net profit	 31.04	vs	   12.07</p>
<p>    Tax provision     2.00	vs	    0.75</p>
<p>NOTE - the company manufactures rubber products mainly for export.</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
